   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "In QISCET ongole there is a dispensary to give preliminary treatment to all the students and faculty members based on their health conditions."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "A dispensary is the room or area in a hospital where medicine is prepared and given out to patients."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Our dispensary doctor Dr. K. Krishna Mohan, is taking care of seizure disease who are facing problems in the College. And also given primary treatment for many viral fevers, Headache, Vomiting’s, diarrhoea, and wounds or injuries in the Dispensary."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
